  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; float: none; display: inline !important;\" wfd-id=\"17\">(8 fotos) Poco antes de las 13.30 horas de este martes se ha producido un accidente laboral en el Centro Log&iacute;stico 5 B de Pamesa en Onda, en el camino Miralcamp,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; float: none; display: inline !important;\" wfd-id=\"16\">donde un trabajador de 43 a&ntilde;os vecino de Murcia se ha precipitado de unos 3 metros de&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; float: none; display: inline !important;\" wfd-id=\"15\">altura y ha caido entre unos palets.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0101.jpg\" alt=\"img_0101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0103.jpg\" alt=\"img_0103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0104.jpg\" alt=\"img_0104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0105.jpg\" alt=\"img_0105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0106.jpg\" alt=\"img_0106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0109.jpg\" alt=\"img_0109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentlaboralcentrelogisticpamesa5b/img_0113.jpg\" alt=\"img_0113\" styl